# 2026-11-07 i.MX6ULL 网关冒烟测试

平台：

```text
i.MX6ULL ATK-IMX6U
Linux 4.1.15
can0 500 kbps
PC broker: 192.168.137.1:1883
board eth0: 192.168.137.103/24
```

## gatewayd

```bash
cd /home/root/my_ai
nohup ./gatewayd -c gatewayd.conf >/var/log/gatewayd.log 2>&1 &
```

启动日志：

```text
gatewayd: can=can0 db=/home/root/my_ai/gateway.db
          socket=/run/gatewayd.sock mqtt=192.168.137.1:1883
```

## gwctl

